COMMENT ON COLUMN MSS.PING_IP.ADDRESS_HIGH IS '64 highest bits of IP address (is NULL for IPv4)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN MSS.PING_IP.ADDRESS_LOW IS '64 lowest bits of IP address';

